---
import Legal from '@/layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '@/site.config';
---
<Legal title="Privacy notice" description={`How ${site.name} uses personal and health information from consultations, coaching and this website.`} reviewed={site.legal.policiesReviewed}>
  <h2>Who I am</h2><p>{site.legal.legalName}, {site.address.line1}, {site.address.town} {site.address.postcode}. Contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
  <h2>What I collect and why</h2><ul><li><strong>Consultation bookings:</strong> name, contact details, goal and training experience — to run the consult and follow up (steps prior to a contract).</li><li><strong>Clients:</strong> training logs, measurements, injury and health information you choose to share (special category data — processed with your explicit consent, which you can withdraw), payments. Needed to coach you safely. Retained for 2 years after your last session.</li><li><strong>Website:</strong> no analytics or advertising cookies by default.</li></ul>
  <h2>Sharing</h2><p>Training data lives in the coaching app we use (processor); booking and form submissions go through the providers configured for this site. Nothing is sold. I will never share health information without your consent, except where legally required.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2><p>Access, correction, deletion, restriction, objection, and withdrawal of consent: email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. Complaints: <a href="https://ico.org.uk" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a>.</p>
</Legal>
